{
  "answer": "Employees working remotely are provided with a laptop and, upon request, a monitor and an ergonomic chair for their home setup [5a04c330c14efaf8f4da83ebf6d6854f]. Additionally, a one-time stipend is available for a home internet upgrade if the existing connection does not meet the minimum bandwidth specified by the IT team for video calls and remote development work [5a04c330c14efaf8f4da83ebf6d6854f].",
  "citations": [
